@startuml
title Order flow
participant Alice as A
actor "Bob B" as B #LightBlue
database DB <<storage>>

A -> B: Place order
B --> A : Accepted
A ->> DB: save
note left of A #yellow: a short note
note over A, B
  A note on several lines.
  The words alt, loop and end are text here.
end note
alt success
  A -[#red]> B: ok
else failure
  B -> A: error
end
@enduml
